{"book":"hono","chapter":"guides","chapterTitle":"الأدلة","slug":"best-practices","title":"أفضل الممارسات","headings":[{"depth":2,"id":"لا-تنشئ-quotcontrollersquot-عندما-يكون-ذلك-ممكنا","text":"لا تُنشئ &quot;Controllers&quot; عندما يكون ذلك ممكنًا"},{"depth":2,"id":"factorycreatehandlers-في-honofactory","text":"factory.createHandlers() في hono/factory"},{"depth":2,"id":"بناء-تطبيق-أكبر","text":"بناء تطبيق أكبر"},{"depth":3,"id":"إذا-كنت-تريد-استخدام-ميزات-rpc","text":"إذا كنت تريد استخدام ميزات RPC"},{"depth":2,"id":"أفضل-ممارسات-طلبات-head","text":"أفضل ممارسات طلبات HEAD"},{"depth":3,"id":"فهم-معالجة-head-في-hono","text":"فهم معالجة HEAD في Hono"},{"depth":3,"id":"افعل-استخدم-مسارات-get-لطلبات-head","text":"✅ افعل: استخدم مسارات GET لطلبات HEAD"},{"depth":3,"id":"افعل-استخدم-برمجية-وسيطة-لمنطق-خاص-بـ-head","text":"✅ افعل: استخدم برمجية وسيطة لمنطق خاص بـ HEAD"},{"depth":3,"id":"لا-تفعل-محاولة-إنشاء-معالجات-head-مخصصة","text":"❌ لا تفعل: محاولة إنشاء معالجات HEAD مخصّصة"},{"depth":3,"id":"اعتبارات-الأداء","text":"اعتبارات الأداء"},{"depth":3,"id":"اختبار-طلبات-head","text":"اختبار طلبات HEAD"},{"depth":3,"id":"ملاحظات","text":"ملاحظات"}],"html":"<p>Hono مرن جداً. يمكنك كتابة تطبيقك كما تشاء.\nومع ذلك، هناك أفضل الممارسات التي يُفضّل اتباعها.</p>\n<h2 id=\"لا-تنشئ-quotcontrollersquot-عندما-يكون-ذلك-ممكنا\">لا تُنشئ &quot;Controllers&quot; عندما يكون ذلك ممكنًا</h2>\n<p>عند الإمكان، يجب ألا تنشئ &quot;وحدات تحكم (Controllers) شبيهة بـ Ruby on Rails&quot;.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">// 🙁</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// A RoR-like Controller</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">booksList</span> = (<span class=\"hljs-params\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">c</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Context</span></span>) =&gt; {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">json</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;list books&#x27;</span>)\n}\n\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/books&#x27;</span>, booksList)\n</code></pre>\n<p>المشكلة متعلقة بالأنواع. على سبيل المثال، لا يمكن استنتاج معامل المسار في وحدة التحكم (Controller) دون كتابة أنواع عامة (generics) معقدة.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">// 🙁</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// A RoR-like Controller</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">bookPermalink</span> = (<span class=\"hljs-params\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">c</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Context</span></span>) =&gt; {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> id = c.<span class=\"hljs-property\">req</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">param</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;id&#x27;</span>) <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Can&#x27;t infer the path param</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">json</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">`get <span class=\"hljs-subst\">${id}</span>`</span>)\n}\n</code></pre>\n<p>لذلك، لا تحتاج إلى إنشاء وحدات تحكم (controllers) بأسلوب RoR ويجب كتابة المعالجات (handlers) مباشرة بعد تعريفات المسار.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">// 😃</span>\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/books/:id&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> id = c.<span class=\"hljs-property\">req</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">param</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;id&#x27;</span>) <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Can infer the path param</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">json</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">`get <span class=\"hljs-subst\">${id}</span>`</span>)\n})\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"factorycreatehandlers-في-honofactory\"><code>factory.createHandlers()</code> في <code>hono/factory</code></h2>\n<p>إذا كنت لا تزال تريد إنشاء متحكّم (Controller) شبيه بـ RoR، فاستخدم <code>factory.createHandlers()</code> في <a href=\"https://hono.dev/docs/helpers/factory\"><code>hono/factory</code></a>. إذا استخدمت هذا، سيعمل استنتاج الأنواع (type inference) بشكل صحيح.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { createFactory } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono/factory&#x27;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { logger } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono/logger&#x27;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// ...</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// 😃</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> factory = <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">createFactory</span>()\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> middleware = factory.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">createMiddleware</span>(<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">async</span> (c, next) =&gt; {\n  c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">set</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;foo&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;bar&#x27;</span>)\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">await</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">next</span>()\n})\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> handlers = factory.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">createHandlers</span>(<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">logger</span>(), middleware, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">json</span>(c.<span class=\"hljs-property\">var</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">foo</span>)\n})\n\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/api&#x27;</span>, ...handlers)\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"بناء-تطبيق-أكبر\">بناء تطبيق أكبر</h2>\n<p>استخدم <code>app.route()</code> لبناء تطبيق أكبر دون إنشاء &quot;وحدات تحكم بأسلوب Ruby on Rails&quot;.</p>\n<p>إذا كان تطبيقك يحتوي على <code>/authors</code> و <code>/books</code> نقاط النهاية وأردت فصل الملفات عن <code>index.ts</code>، أنشئ <code>authors.ts</code> و <code>books.ts</code>.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">// authors.ts</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono&#x27;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> app = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span>()\n\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">json</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;list authors&#x27;</span>))\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">post</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">json</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;create an author&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-number\">201</span>))\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/:id&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">json</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">`get <span class=\"hljs-subst\">${c.req.param(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;id&#x27;</span>)}</span>`</span>))\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">default</span> app\n</code></pre>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">// books.ts</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono&#x27;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> app = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span>()\n\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">json</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;list books&#x27;</span>))\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">post</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">json</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;create a book&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-number\">201</span>))\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/:id&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">json</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">`get <span class=\"hljs-subst\">${c.req.param(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;id&#x27;</span>)}</span>`</span>))\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">default</span> app\n</code></pre>\n<p>ثم استوردها وثبّتها على المسارات <code>/authors</code> و <code>/books</code> مع <code>app.route()</code>.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">// index.ts</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono&#x27;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> authors <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;./authors&#x27;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> books <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;./books&#x27;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> app = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span>()\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// 😃</span>\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">route</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/authors&#x27;</span>, authors)\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">route</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/books&#x27;</span>, books)\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">default</span> app\n</code></pre>\n<h3 id=\"إذا-كنت-تريد-استخدام-ميزات-rpc\">إذا كنت تريد استخدام ميزات RPC</h3>\n<p>يعمل الكود أعلاه جيدًا لحالات الاستخدام العادية.\nومع ذلك، إذا كنت تريد استخدام <code>RPC</code> ميزة، يمكنك الحصول على النوع الصحيح عبر التسلسل (chaining) كما يلي.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">// authors.ts</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono&#x27;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> app = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span>()\n  .<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">json</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;list authors&#x27;</span>))\n  .<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">post</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">json</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;create an author&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-number\">201</span>))\n  .<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/:id&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">json</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">`get <span class=\"hljs-subst\">${c.req.param(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;id&#x27;</span>)}</span>`</span>))\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">default</span> app\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">type</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">AppType</span> = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">typeof</span> app\n</code></pre>\n<p>إذا مرّرتَ نوع <code>app</code> إلى <code>hc</code>، فسيحصل على النوع الصحيح.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">type</span> { <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">AppType</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;./authors&#x27;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { hc } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono/client&#x27;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// 😃</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> client = hc&lt;<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">AppType</span>&gt;(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;http://localhost&#x27;</span>) <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Typed correctly</span>\n</code></pre>\n<p>لمزيد من المعلومات التفصيلية، راجع <a href=\"https://hono.dev/docs/guides/rpc#using-rpc-with-larger-applications\">صفحة <code>RPC</code></a>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"أفضل-ممارسات-طلبات-head\">أفضل ممارسات طلبات HEAD</h2>\n<h3 id=\"فهم-معالجة-head-في-hono\">فهم معالجة HEAD في Hono</h3>\n<p>يتعامل Hono تلقائيًا مع طلبات HEAD بتحويلها إلى طلبات GET وإزالة نص الاستجابة. هذا السلوك مدمج في طبقة التوزيع (dispatch) الخاصة بالإطار ويحدث قبل إجراء مطابقة المسار.</p>\n<h3 id=\"افعل-استخدم-مسارات-get-لطلبات-head\">✅ افعل: استخدم مسارات GET لطلبات HEAD</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-typescript\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">// GOOD: This GET route automatically handles HEAD requests</span>\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/api/users&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">async</span> (c) =&gt; {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> users = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">await</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">getUsers</span>()\n  c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">header</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;X-Total-Count&#x27;</span>, users.<span class=\"hljs-property\">length</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">toString</span>())\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">json</span>(users)\n})\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// HEAD /api/users will return:</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// - Same headers as GET (including X-Total-Count)</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// - Status 200</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// - No body (null)</span>\n</code></pre>\n<h3 id=\"افعل-استخدم-برمجية-وسيطة-لمنطق-خاص-بـ-head\">✅ افعل: استخدم برمجية وسيطة لمنطق خاص بـ HEAD</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-typescript\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">// GOOD: Use middleware when HEAD needs different behavior</span>\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">use</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/api/resource&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">async</span> (c, next) =&gt; {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">await</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">next</span>()\n\n  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Add HEAD-specific headers after the handler</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> (c.<span class=\"hljs-property\">req</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">method</span> === <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;HEAD&#x27;</span>) {\n    c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">header</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;X-HEAD-Processed&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;true&#x27;</span>)\n    <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Don&#x27;t compute expensive body content for HEAD</span>\n    c.<span class=\"hljs-property\">res</span> = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Response</span>(<span class=\"hljs-literal\">null</span>, c.<span class=\"hljs-property\">res</span>)\n  }\n})\n</code></pre>\n<h3 id=\"لا-تفعل-محاولة-إنشاء-معالجات-head-مخصصة\">❌ لا تفعل: محاولة إنشاء معالجات HEAD مخصّصة</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-typescript\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">// BAD: This won&#x27;t work as expected</span>\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">head</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/api/users&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// This handler will NEVER be called</span>\n  c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">header</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;X-Custom&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;value&#x27;</span>)\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">text</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;ignored&#x27;</span>)\n})\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// BAD: Using on() also won&#x27;t work</span>\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">on</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;HEAD&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/api/users&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Still converted to GET before route matching</span>\n})\n</code></pre>\n<h3 id=\"اعتبارات-الأداء\">اعتبارات الأداء</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>تجنب العمليات المكلفة في معالجات GET إذا كنت تتوقع العديد من طلبات HEAD</strong>: استخدم وسيطًا لاكتشاف HEAD وتخطي توليد النص (body)</li>\n<li><strong>تعمل ترويسات التخزين المؤقت بشكل مماثل</strong>: تحترم استجابات HEAD نفس قواعد التخزين المؤقت مثل GET</li>\n<li><strong>توافق الوسائط (Middleware compatibility)</strong>: تعمل معظم الوسائط مع HEAD، لكن وسائط معالجة النص (مثل الضغط) تتخطى طلبات HEAD تلقائيًا</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"اختبار-طلبات-head\">اختبار طلبات HEAD</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-typescript\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Always test both GET and HEAD responses</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">it</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;handles HEAD requests correctly&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">async</span> () =&gt; {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> getRes = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">await</span> app.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">request</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/api/users&#x27;</span>)\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> headRes = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">await</span> app.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">request</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/api/users&#x27;</span>, { <span class=\"hljs-attr\">method</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;HEAD&#x27;</span> })\n\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">expect</span>(headRes.<span class=\"hljs-property\">status</span>).<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">toBe</span>(getRes.<span class=\"hljs-property\">status</span>)\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">expect</span>(headRes.<span class=\"hljs-property\">headers</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;X-Total-Count&#x27;</span>)).<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">toBe</span>(\n    getRes.<span class=\"hljs-property\">headers</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;X-Total-Count&#x27;</span>)\n  )\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">expect</span>(headRes.<span class=\"hljs-property\">body</span>).<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">toBe</span>(<span class=\"hljs-literal\">null</span>)\n})\n</code></pre>\n<h3 id=\"ملاحظات\">ملاحظات</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>يضمن التحويل التلقائي إلى HEAD اتساق الترويسات بين استجابات GET و HEAD</li>\n<li>هذا السلوك متسق عبر جميع بيئات تشغيل Hono (Cloudflare Workers و Deno و Bun و Node.js)</li>\n<li>إذا كنت بحاجة إلى منطق مختلف تمامًا لـ HEAD مقابل GET، ففكر في استخدام نقاط نهاية (endpoints) مختلفة بدلًا من محاولة تجاوز معالجة HEAD الخاصة بالإطار (framework)</li>\n</ul>\n"}